%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'fontFamily': 'Inter' }}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as ClientApplicationRuntime
    participant Auth as AuthenticationService
    participant Pres as PresenceManager
    participant Router as MessageRoutingEngine
    participant Session as SessionContextManager
    participant File as FileTransferCoordinator
    participant Audit as SystemAuditSubsystem

    Note over C, Audit: Authentication & Session Establishment
    C->>Auth: LoginRequest (Credentials)
    Auth->>Auth: Validate Credentials
    Auth-->>C: SessionContext + AuthResult
    Auth->>Pres: RegisterUser(UserID)
    Pres->>Audit: LogConnectionEvent
    Pres-->>C: PresenceBroadcast(ActiveUsers)

    Note over C, Audit: Real-Time Messaging Flow
    C->>Router: EncryptedMessagePayload (Recipient/Group)
    Router->>Auth: ValidateSession(SessionContext)
    Auth-->>Router: SessionValid
    Router->>Pres: ResolveRecipients(UserID)
    Pres-->>Router: RecipientList
    Router->>Router: VerifyIntegrity & InjectTimestamp
    Router->>Session: AppendBuffer(MessageBuffer)
    Router-->>C: DeliveryStatus
    Router->>C: PushEncryptedPayload (via Persistent Channel)
    C->>C: Decrypt, Store Local, Notify UI

    Note over C, Audit: File Transfer Coordination
    C->>File: TransferInitiationRequest(FileMetadata)
    File->>Auth: ValidateSender(SessionContext)
    Auth-->>File: Authorized
    File->>File: CreateTransferSessionToken
    File->>Router: SyncMetadata(MetadataSyncEvent)
    Router-->>C: PushTransferNotification
    C->>C: Display Transfer UI

    Note over C, Audit: Presence & Recovery
    C->>Pres: HeartbeatSignal
    Pres->>Pres: UpdateStatus(Online)
    Pres-->>C: PresenceBroadcast(StatusUpdate)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Audit: Administrative Oversight
        C->>Audit: AdminInventoryRequest
        Audit->>Pres: QueryActiveUsers
        Pres-->>Audit: ActiveUserSnapshot
        Audit-->>C: ActiveUserReport
    end

    Note over C, Audit: Session Termination
    C->>Auth: LogoutRequest
    Auth->>Pres: UnregisterUser(UserID)
    Pres->>Session: TerminateSession(SessionID)
    Session->>Session: PurgeBuffers
    Pres-->>C: PresenceBroadcast(OfflineUpdate)
    Pres->>Audit: LogDisconnectionEvent